Instructions
Kahan Paste Karein:
Is PHP code ko apni WordPress theme ki functions.php file mein paste karein (Child Theme ka use karna behtar hai) ya phir kisi Code Snippets plugin ke zariye add karein.

Elementor Me Kaise Use Karein:

WordPress dashboard mein Elementor editor open karein jahan aapne Posts ya Loop Grid widget lagaya hua hai.

Widget ki settings mein Query section par jayein.

Query ID wale field mein exact yeh naam likh dein: skip_first_post

Kaise Kaam Karega:
Yeh code automatically query ka pehla post skip kar dega, jisse aapka pehla post repeat nahi hoga aur aap use alag se Featured Post ke taur par dikha sakenge.



function skip_first_post_query( $query ) {
    $query->set( 'offset', 1 );
}
add_action( 'elementor/query/skip_first_post', 'skip_first_post_query' );
